DECLVAR|DECLFUN:
  - Declares the existance of a binding in scope (needed for top level script bindings)

INIT:
  - Marks the start/end of a TDZ for a binding
  - Const check not needed

SAFE:
  - Directly updating a value known to be outside TDZ
  - Const check needed

THISINIT:
  - Initializes the 'this' binding

::Stmts::

GWrite:
  INIT, DECLVAR | DECLFUNC

LWrite:
  INIT, SAFE, THISINIT

RWrite:
  INIT, SAFE, THISINIT

MWrite:
  INIT, SAFE
